Common Type Diploma
    documentation 'This educational entity represents the conferring or certification by an 
                  'educational organization that the student has successfully completed a 
                  'particular course of study. It represents the electronic version of its 
                  'physical document counterpart.
    include Achievement
        documentation 'An entity that includes information about achievement earned by a learner 
                      'upon fulfilling a specified criteria.
        is required
    date DiplomaAwardDate
        documentation 'The month, day, and year on which the student met  graduation requirements and 
                      'was awarded a diploma.
        is part of identity
    enumeration DiplomaLevel
        documentation 'The level of diploma/credential that is awarded to a student in recognition of 
                      'his/her completion of the curricular requirements.
                      '
                      'Minimum high school program
                      '
                      'Recommended high school program
                      '
                      'Distinguished Achievement Program.
        is optional
    enumeration DiplomaType
        documentation 'The type of diploma/credential that is awarded to a student in recognition of 
                      'his/her completion of the curricular requirements.
        is part of identity
    bool CTECompleter
        documentation 'Indicated a student who reached a state-defined threshold of vocational 
                      'education and who attained a high school diploma or its recognized state 
                      'equivalent or GED.
        is optional
    string DiplomaDescription
        documentation 'The description of diploma given to the student for accomplishments.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 80
    date DiplomaAwardExpiresDate
        documentation 'Date on which the award expires.
        is optional